<div id="orders_vat_manager_panel" class="panel">
    <h3><i class="fal fa-info-circle"></i>&nbsp;{l s='Information' mod='advancedvatmanager'}</h3>
    <p>{l s='This list shows the orders placed and that are exempt from taxes or are orders subject to the Brexit regulations (As long as the Brexit option is activated from the [Brexit] section of the module configuration page).' mod='advancedvatmanager'}</p>
    <p>{l s='Statistical information is also displayed regarding the total amounts of orders that are exempt from taxes, as well as orders placed under the Brexit regulation.' mod='advancedvatmanager'}</p>
    <br />
    <div class="alert alert-info">
        1. {l s='Only the orders made by customers since the module was installed in the shop will be shown in the list of orders.' mod='advancedvatmanager'}
        <br />
        2. {l s='Only revenue from orders that have already been invoiced is shown in the statistics.' mod='advancedvatmanager'}
    </div>
</div>
